.TH CASEFIX 1.SH NAMEcasefix \- sentence case.SH SYNOPSIS\fBcasefix\fR< infile > outfile.SH DESCRIPTIONA filter: it copies its standard input to its standard output with everyletter in lower case except the first of each sentence..nf    THIS IS LOUD. and this is quiet! WHY? yes.    This is loud. And this is quiet! Why? Yes..fiIt reads only the standard input; a file named as an argument isignored..SH SEE ALSOtr